think Earth breathes in: take the fact at the door before any argument about it. The rota's dual seat is foundations/20260703-202312_the-marked-value.md, whose Status reads "lap one witness waits on seed".
think Checked the claim rather than repeating it. amphora/manifest_entry.rye publishes mark_plain_bytes and mark_manifest, mark_verdict answers .known on exactly those two, parse_manifest_line refuses an unknown mark with error.UnknownMark, build_manifest_lines writes the three-field line. Lap one is built.
think Then pressed the foundation's load-bearing claim -- exactly TWO hardcoded roots -- and asked what holds it. Nothing did. src/shape/tilak-root-count.glow displays example 2; its leg in tools/gen/chapter/src_first_resident_witness.rish greps that pedestal for plain-bytes, manifest and %tile, three strings the file already holds, and opens the engine never.
think Measured the class rather than guessing it: grep -oE 'grep -q [^&|]*' over that witness names 17 pedestals and exactly two non-pedestal paths. Three pedestals genuinely compare against brushstroke/brush_parse.rye (the repair REDS %358 bought), one against a .brush fixture, thirteen against literals typed in the witness beside them.
think Chose to move ONE rather than sweep twelve -- each of the twelve wants its own reading of its own source, and a sweep of twelve at once is how a repair becomes its own red. The one moved is the rota seat's own.
think Wrote five readings that fire apart, then argued a fifth away in the scan header as unable to fire alone -- and the pen found the case the argument missed: a bare-literal arm whose constant is later renamed. The engine then publishes vessel, answers on manifest, and every other reading agrees. The reading went back in, and both the header and the control now carry the correction.
think Reds first: the cold open answered say_compose_bound red, deferred 538 per mille against a ceiling of 537. Repaired seven sites in my own lane rather than the minimum elsewhere.
obs A guard that reads a file for words that file already contains proves the file is self-consistent and nothing else. That is the whole shape of the thirteen, and it reads exactly like coverage from the README's Witness column.
obs A control earns its place by correcting the header above it. Reasoning said the fifth reading could never fire alone; twenty-one planted cases said otherwise, in the one shape reasoning had not enumerated.
obs The say_compose ratchet closed at 537 of 537 on my own repair -- zero slack. On the send's rebase it read 531, because Incense repaired eighteen sites of the same red in its own lane within the hour. Two ships on one ratchet, neither able to see the other was working it, which is the claim question this card has asked since 20260906.212057 and nobody has answered.
obs The foundation's Status line stands word for word; the erratum accretes beside it. Dated testimony keeps every word, and facts move by erratum (accrete-never-break, tier 2).
